        <name>Unavailable</name>
        <qualifiedname>llvm::mca::ResourceState::Unavailable</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>This field is set if this resource is currently reserved. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Resources can be reserved for a number of cycles. Instructions can still be dispatched to reserved resources. However, istructions dispatched to a reserved resource cannot be issued to the underlying units (i.e. pipelines) until the resource is released. </para>
